1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:02,298
I wake up in the morning.

2
00:00:03,553 --> 00:00:05,394
I open my eyes.

3
00:00:06,649 --> 00:00:08,685
I turn off my alarm.

4
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:11,970
I sit up in bed.

5
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:15,239
I stretch my arms.

6
00:00:16,609 --> 00:00:18,570
I am ready to get up.

7
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:22,115
I move the blanket.

8
00:00:23,328 --> 00:00:25,741
I put my feet on the floor.

9
00:00:26,954 --> 00:00:28,727
I get out of bed.

10
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:32,116
I walk to the window.

11
00:00:33,359 --> 00:00:35,478
I open the curtains.

12
00:00:36,721 --> 00:00:38,697
I open the window.

13
00:00:40,120 --> 00:00:41,781
I make my bed.

14
00:00:42,963 --> 00:00:45,252
I pull the blanket straight.

15
00:00:46,434 --> 00:00:48,758
I smooth it with my hands.

16
00:00:50,120 --> 00:00:52,262
I walk to the bathroom.

17
00:00:53,430 --> 00:00:55,738
I stop beside the sink.

18
00:00:56,906 --> 00:00:58,772
I turn on the tap.

19
00:01:00,120 --> 00:01:02,019
I wash my hands.

20
00:01:03,228 --> 00:01:05,075
I wash my face.

21
00:01:06,283 --> 00:01:08,731
The cool water wakes me up.

22
00:01:10,120 --> 00:01:12,380
I pick up my toothbrush.

23
00:01:13,579 --> 00:01:15,395
I brush my teeth.

24
00:01:16,595 --> 00:01:18,741
I keep my teeth clean.

25
00:01:20,120 --> 00:01:22,008
I turn off the tap.

26
00:01:23,344 --> 00:01:25,444
I take a soft towel.

27
00:01:26,780 --> 00:01:28,604
I dry my face.

28
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:31,976
I look in the mirror.

29
00:01:33,451 --> 00:01:35,069
I comb my hair.

30
00:01:36,544 --> 00:01:38,465
Now my hair is neat.

31
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:42,146
I walk to the kitchen.

32
00:01:43,479 --> 00:01:45,277
I pick up my cup.

33
00:01:46,610 --> 00:01:48,607
I drink some water.

34
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:52,010
I pick up my bag.

35
00:01:53,347 --> 00:01:55,130
I walk outside.

36
00:01:56,467 --> 00:01:58,603
I am ready for the day.
